  "body": "Found by the second review of PR #2668 (comment 7001940941). The PR is merged (4a326c7d9).\n\nWhat happens: the check in `crates/app/src/operation/feed_rating.rs:104-133` compares the feed of a Drill or Thread operation with the cutting-data row of the material in force. Without such a row it uses the running feed of the tool.\n\nA change of the running feed does not change a material row. If the user sets the running feed below the row, an operation at the feed of the row posts with no refusal.\n\nWhy P3: the posted feed can be above a limit that the user set on the tool. There is a workaround: edit the material row too.\n\nDone means: the check uses the lower of the two values, or the decision entry `docs/decisions/2598-hole-op-tool-feed.md` says why it does not. A test pins the behaviour.\n",
